Package: msxbas2rom
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MSX BASIC to ROM compiler
 msxbas2rom is a command-line tool that converts MSX-BASIC source files
 into ROM format, supporting plain ROM and MegaROM mappers.
